Third-party components
----------------------

The container image includes the embedding model bge-small-en-v1.5
(https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5), Copyright (c) 2022
staoxiao (FlagEmbedding, https://github.com/FlagOpen/FlagEmbedding),
licensed under the MIT License, in the int8 ONNX conversion published at
https://huggingface.co/Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5. It is downloaded at build
time (scripts/fetch-model.sh), not stored in this repository.

The Open Graph card fonts in src/Weesite.Content/Fonts/ are Inter
(https://github.com/rsms/inter), Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project
Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(src/Weesite.Content/Fonts/LICENSE.txt).

