and IBM Plex Mono (https://github.com/IBM/plex), Copyright (c) 2017 IBM
Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex", licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (src/Weesite.Web/wwwroot/fonts/OFL.txt).

